16
00:00:35,293 --> 00:00:37,307
Pabrik tak perlu lagi di tepi sungai.

17
00:00:37,844 --> 00:00:39,256
Uap lalu naik ke rel.

18
00:00:39,437 --> 00:00:41,444
Tahun seribu delapan ratus tiga puluh,

19
00:00:41,464 --> 00:00:44,471
kereta uap menghubungkan Liverpool dan Manchester.

20
00:00:44,971 --> 00:00:47,471
Perubahan paling terasa ada di hidup sehari-hari.

21
00:00:47,641 --> 00:00:48,670
Orang pindah ke kota,

22
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:50,372
